# Sevev 9 @2 — the double-density companion of Sevev 9. SOURCE OF TRUTH (edit here, then run the pipeline).
#
# Same letters, same box, twice the pixels: every glyph of sevev9.glyphs redrawn on a 2x grid and drawn at
# half the scale, so it covers exactly the box its Sevev 9 twin covers (Bar's "sharper text", 2026-09-29).
#
# Cell: 18 rows = ascender 4 (rows 0-3) + body 10 (rows 4-13) + descender 4 (rows 14-17).
# The baseline sits under row 13. Width = the row length and MUST be exactly 2 x the Sevev 9 glyph's width.
# Advance = width + 2 (= 2 x the Sevev 9 advance). The space advances 8 (space 6 + 2). Line height 22, base 16.
# The pipeline FAILS if any code point's advance is not exactly 2 x its Sevev 9 advance, or the char set,
# aliases, zero-width set, line height, baseline or kerning differ (font.check_companion).
#
# Same block syntax as sevev9.glyphs ('== U+XXXX', alias, zero, space); 18 rows per glyph.
#
# Stroke model (2D Artist): the Hebrew square script's contrast. Horizontal strokes (roofs, bases, bars) are
# 2 @2 px, i.e. the Sevev 9 weight; vertical stems are 1 @2 px; diagonals are 2 px per row stepping 1.
# Round corners are a 1-px chamfer step, square corners stay square. Dots and commas are 2x2.
# Letter logic, now with room to breathe (style-guide §7):
#   ב square corners + base tail past the stem · כ rounded right side, no tail
#   ד roof overhangs the leg · ר/ך rounded corner (ך descends) · ה left leg detached (2-row gap), inset
#   ח left leg attached · ת left leg inset with a 2-row foot kicking left
#   ו hook + stem · ז centred bar over a stem · ן ו's shape descending
#   ס rounded bottom and top-right, square top-left · ם square on all four corners
#   ע long base kicking left, arm meets a vertical · צ crossed top on a full base
#   ' ׳ " ״ raised, tapered ticks, so מס׳ never reads מסי.
# Digits: all 8 wide except 1 (6), as in Sevev 9; one shared height, baseline and round-shoulder set.
# ₪: 14 x 12 (rows 2-13) = 2 x Sevev 9's 7 x 6; the two hooks mirror about the centre, each inner wall
# stops 2 rows short so they never merge. Pictograms: an EPX pass of the Sevev 9 art, ⬅ redrawn filled.
# Provenance: 2D Artist, 2026-09-29, from Sevev 9 (pipeline/od-sevev/font/sevev9.glyphs).

